    SourceNotes: 'Eight named 256 x 256 source directions from pictures/gogos-minis.
      PNG bytes preserved. Idle breathing and articulated movement are provisional.
      One separate authored attack view per direction is combined with anticipation/contact/recovery;
      the 4 x 2 sheet is not played as eight temporal frames.

      September 14,
      2026: exact supplied design from pictures/gogos-minis; immutable source in
      Assets/art/units/user-sept14/bugaloo/bugaloo-source.png. Approved combat animation
      and board scale preserved.

      Directional-v1: Assets/art/units/directional-v1/bugaloo-atlas.png;
      portrait and presentation size preserved.'
