    SourceNotes: 'Latest user-selected Tauris, September 12 2026: cool blue-gray
      knucklebone head, shallow central top dip, white slanted pupil-less eyes and
      broad jagged grin. Two tiny round feet attach directly beneath the torso, matching
      the user''s final cropped reference; long legs and boots removed. White pixel
      outline retained. Board width reduced by 25 percent from the prior version.
      75 authored idle/movement/melee bite/death poses in five views and three intentional
      mirrored directions. Reference and exact built-in imagegen prompts: docs/tauris-user-design.md.
      Anuik''s approved art remains unchanged.

      September 14, 2026: exact supplied
      design from pictures/gogos-minis; immutable source in Assets/art/units/user-sept14/tauris/tauris-source.png.
      Approved combat animation and board scale preserved.

      Directional-v1:
      Assets/art/units/directional-v1/tauris-special.png; portrait and presentation
      size preserved.'
